      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.48,
      "end_seconds": 257.64,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So, based on the history and the examination, the most likely explanation is a possible adrenal crisis after stopping steroids."
