      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.15,
      "end_seconds": 285.26,
      "duration_seconds": 21.11,
      "text": "I can't promise yet but most people with a possible adrenal crisis after stopping steroids do well once it's treated properly i think blood tests makes sense here for adrenal crisis i'm going to put you on hydrocortisone 100 milligrams once now single dose that should help with adrenal crisis"
    },
