      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.05,
      "end_seconds": 306.5,
      "duration_seconds": 13.45,
      "text": "I am giving an injection now and calling an ambulance. I'll want another look straight away. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
